<title>UK: Bear Stearns leads $250 million 30-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns leads $250 million 30-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns. The deal is guaranteed by Bankers Trust Company on a subordinated basis.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BTC CAPITAL TRUST 1</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	SPREAD     +75 BP    MATURITY   *  .DEC.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    30.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2**	ISS PRICE  98.0221   FULL FEES   0.875</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-**	REOFFER    98.0221</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AFTER 10 YEARS AT PAR</p>
<p>		**ISSUER</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
